Package: fungioutline
Title: Tools for Fungal Taxonomic Outlines and Genome Sampling
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("FungiOutline contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.com")
Description: Provides tidy tools for importing, validating, standardizing,
    comparing, and analyzing expert-curated fungal taxonomic outline tables,
    public genome metadata, BUSCO quality results, and optional sequence
    availability summaries.
